  "name": "Peak Country Northern Colorado Hail History Dataset, 2016–2025",
  "description": "Source-traceable historical hail observations for Weld and Larimer Counties, Colorado, 2016–2025, including a geodesic 25-mile Greeley-reference subset, source-aware provenance, descriptive summaries and figures. These are historical reports, not a storm-frequency trend or site-specific damage determination.",
